#: 48c15101f14541f1a6ead0bf34c2bf69
msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "Bajo el capó"

#: 146c73d80e6e455a89c1ead6c03eefb8
msgid ""
"In order to better comply with the conventions of a [12-factor "
"app](https://www.12factor.net/), Pytition is able to load configuration "
"variables without modifying any source files or `*.py` files. The "
"following diagrams explain how this works."
msgstr ""
"Con el fin de cumplir mejor con las convenciones de una "
"[aplicación de 12 factores](https://www.12factor.net/), Pytition puede "
"cargar variables de configuración sin modificar ningún archivo fuente ni "
"archivo `*.py`. Los siguientes diagramas explican cómo funciona."

#: c7a180c6c99040d6a17c7c67103f59c6
msgid ""
"You can still edit the variables directly in the `config/settings/**.py` "
"files, but this is not recommended as the file may be overwritten on the "
"next update."
msgstr ""
"Aún puede editar las variables directamente en los archivos `config/settings/"
"**.py`, pero no es recomendable, ya que el archivo podría sobrescribirse en "
"la próxima actualización."

#: 59b6fdb9d7454adbafce3b73e9a7c629
msgid "Settings structure"
msgstr "Estructura de configuración"

#: 390b656ac1894bcc941d82de878b8b3a
msgid "Load order"
msgstr "Orden de carga"

#: 59c05a525e324394ab58a8dad3af8056
msgid "All env variables"
msgstr "Todas las variables de entorno"

#: 4c2d0670484346f68740c9329fec3d2b
msgid ""
"Here is the complete list of all environment variables that Pytition can "
"read. For each variable, you will find."
msgstr ""
"Aquí está la lista completa de todas las variables de entorno que Pytition "
"puede leer. Para cada variable, encontrarás."

#: 7d0e1786ce984ce6bde3f652049fc080
msgid "Common environment variables"
msgstr "Variables de entorno comunes"

#: 4d0a9ebea7524779aac8539dc62897ce
msgid "Enables debug mode for development purposes."
msgstr "Habilita el modo de depuración para fines de desarrollo."

#: 4d3d6e18f34446f4b847d3c94323ef8c
msgid "Must be set to `False` in production!"
msgstr "¡Debe establecerse en «False» en producción!"

#: ca9af5bf1d9f4f8aa5dea828f206302d
msgid "Django secret key for cryptographic signing."
msgstr "Clave secreta de Django para la firma criptográfica."

#: 9b7a5d9a64c14bd78b70e9fbf3e487a9
msgid ""
"**MUST be overridden in production** via environment variable or secrets "
"manager. You can use `pdm manage generate_secret_key --quiet` to create a"
" strong key."
msgstr ""
"**DEBE sobrescribirse en producción** mediante una variable de entorno o un "
"gestor de secretos. Puede utilizar `pdm manage generate_secret_key --quiet` "
"para crear una clave segura."

#: aca34f6174a249c48a7dee82a326c2ec
msgid ""
"Default database configuration using **SQLite** for development purposes."
" MUST be overridden in production via environment variable or secrets "
"manager."
msgstr ""
"Configuración predeterminada de la base de datos utilizando **SQLite** para "
"fines de desarrollo. DEBE ser sobrescrita en producción mediante una "
"variable de entorno o un gestor de secretos."

#: aba6c508a4304840a507a50002715a1f
msgid "SQLite"
msgstr "SQLite"

#: 27fd657e63764ce3afb35c35e9d427ac
msgid "Relative path to the SQLite database file :"
msgstr "Ruta relativa al archivo de base de datos SQLite:"

#: 04202ca260f04005991fbe8bbf0d7bd8 04337b8449c649dbafe67637417e7d36
#: 18b12cc124e843369670d93e3d6151f4 372ab49f24f84db9850a50c241bdfcf8
#: 695d40776125425b8321b78e0dd0004a 6c7e07750af64fce9d412dfc61e1ee55
#: a3c050ac04e940099d134e3bced29730 ee9a813f0d3547e19b35b43a0e8505a1
msgid ".env"
msgstr ".env"

#: 3113ecfc14134a218c802f0d1785e606
msgid "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./db.sqlite3"
msgstr "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./db.sqlite3"

#: bf7f3f8e39924894a3248909bb0e02b6
msgid "Or absolute path"
msgstr "O ruta absoluta"

#: 71eee49573004f73bf76d5fc18909b76
msgid "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:////absolute/path/to/db.sqlite3"
msgstr "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:////absolute/path/to/db.sqlite3"

#: d876e1bb4c2c454c9e8652f053e4abdf
msgid ""
"For in-memory (not persistent) database (default configuration if "
"`ENV=test`) :"
msgstr ""
"Para bases de datos en memoria (no persistentes) "
"(configuración predeterminada si `ENV=test`):"

#: a78da192b91c42eb94492a0473029188
msgid "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///:memory:"
msgstr "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///:memory:"

#: c5b242a46d2d4a539a5f4340c46f6a84
msgid "If you prefer `DB_` variables :"
msgstr "Si prefiere las variables `DB_` :"

#: be514fc464c6431a849b07a886ce3838
msgid ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.sqlite3\n"
"DB_NAME=/absolute/or/relative/path/to/db.sqlite3"
msgstr ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.sqlite3\n"
"DB_NAME=/absolute/or/relative/path/to/db.sqlite3"

#: 69fa8a3569c749e98721a7b3af7729b2
msgid "PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL"

#: 40304e51a7324389b1036a6310c559c0 5f113ba7d20b4a0589fba1e98d166a86
msgid "With `DATABASE_URL` :"
msgstr "Con `DATABASE_URL` :"

#: 18951ac883f94d43b96faa31bea6fef3
msgid "DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg2://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DB_NAME"
msgstr "DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg2://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DB_NAME"

#: 21d5e0cb60dc428cb3879c6194bdb87b f0feb64cd1ef4906a3a070db74ece1e8
msgid "Or with `DB_` variables :"
msgstr "O con variables `DB_` :"

#: 70e6e042106b4b2f8c314d9950f60714
msgid ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.postgresql\n"
"DB_NAME=<db_name>\n"
"DB_USER=<user>\n"
"DB_PASSWORD=<password>\n"
"DB_HOST=<host>\n"
"DB_PORT=<port>"
msgstr ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.postgresql\n"
"DB_NAME=<db_name>\n"
"DB_USER=<user>\n"
"DB_PASSWORD=<password>\n"
"DB_HOST=<host>\n"
"DB_PORT=<port>"

#: 6ae9b48e55e3456184e49b09b565ae68
msgid "MySQL/MariaDB"
msgstr "MySQL/MariaDB"

#: c6e66257d21e4c9cb1ffdf5e09c17fdd
msgid "DATABASE_URL=mysql+pymysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DB_NAME"
msgstr "DATABASE_URL=mysql+pymysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DB_NAME"

#: 08e556c978354fe488ef575ddb2e02c3
msgid ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.mysql\n"
"DB_NAME=<db_name>\n"
"DB_USER=<user>\n"
"DB_PASSWORD=<password>\n"
"DB_HOST=<host>\n"
"DB_PORT=<port>"
msgstr ""
"DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.mysql\n"
"DB_NAME=<db_name>\n"
"DB_USER=<user>\n"
"DB_PASSWORD=<password>\n"
"DB_HOST=<host>\n"
"DB_PORT=<port>"

